{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o029c","title":"曹植去世","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o029c-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"曹植去世","evidence":["mingdi-e-o029c-q"]},{"id":"rencheng-a-e51f0b0e2815e9d5c7e2","label":"正文","text":"曹植发疾去世","evidence":["rencheng-q-36c88e6502c6b9e7538f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0280","role":"卒","evidence":["mingdi-e-o029c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":232,"label":"十一月庚寅","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y232","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o026","basis":"十一月庚寅"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o029c-q","mingdi-q-o026","mingdi-q-b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o029c-q","source_order":[3,190,"O029c"],"order":812}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0280","name":"曹植","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o029c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3f1f8d121bf35979e5de","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，殄夷将军田豫帅众讨吴将周贺于成山〖14〗，杀贺。十一月，丙寅〖15〗，太白昼现；有星孛于翼〖16〗，近太微上将星〖17〗。庚寅〖18〗，陈思王植薨〖19〗。十二月，行还许昌宫。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：太和六年（公元 232）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d1427f90b1f8dd585e5a","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o026","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-42d0ed5edde34d9ea9f5","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，诏曰：“古之帝王，封建诸侯，所以藩屏王室也〖2〗。《诗》不云乎，‘怀德维宁，宗子维城’〖3〗。秦、汉继周，或强或弱〖4〗，俱失厥中〖5〗。大魏创业，诸王开国；随时之宜，未有定制：非所以永为后法也。其改封诸侯王，皆以郡为国〖6〗。”三月，癸酉〖7〗，行东巡；所过存问高年鳏寡孤独〖8〗，赐谷帛。乙亥〖9〗，月犯轩辕大星。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rencheng-q-36c88e6502c6b9e7538f","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-2e2437b7b03ab49221a6","layer":"original","quote":"时法制：待藩国既自峻迫，僚属皆贾竖下才〖3〗；兵人给其残老，大数不过二百人。又植以前过〖4〗，事事复减半；十一年中而三徙都〖5〗，常汲汲无欢〖6〗。遂发疾，薨，时年四十一。﹝一﹞","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":443,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
